# oracle: fix gcmc full_energy with dimer molecules and pair_modify tail yes: the tail correction changes only at native's pair reinit (insertion trials, and deletion trials while the molecule is only masked out), so after an accepted deletion it still counts the deleted atoms until the next reinit
# oracle-inputs: w32gcmc_dimer.mol
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8
units lj
atom_style molecular
pair_style lj/cut 2.5
pair_modify tail yes
region box block 0 6 0 6 0 6
create_box 1 box
pair_coeff * * 1.0 1.0
mass 1 1.0
molecule dimer w32gcmc_dimer.mol
fix mygcmc all gcmc 1 4 6 0 7791 1.2 0.5 0.6 mol dimer mcmoves 0 1 0 full_energy
thermo_style custom step atoms pe f_mygcmc[1] f_mygcmc[2] f_mygcmc[3] f_mygcmc[4] f_mygcmc[5] f_mygcmc[6]
thermo 10
thermo_modify format float %.15g
run 150
